From: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: nt36536: gate the probe-time engineering reset behind panel-on

Ours (2026-11-01, C2 touch), informed by the Fedora iceland port's patch 0174:
the unconditional nvt_eng_reset in probe reset the live panel. Pairs with 0008
(mzak's follower). Exit: submit to Perpetua together with 0008.

Signed-off-by: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/nt36536/nt36xxx.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/nt36536/nt36xxx.c
index 50090cb8d91f..9e594e5b73aa 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/nt36536/nt36xxx.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/nt36536/nt36xxx.c
@@ -1268,21 +1268,20 @@ static int32_t nvt_ts_probe(struct spi_device *client)
 	/* If the device follows a DRM panel, configure panel follower */
 	if (drm_is_panel_follower(&client->dev)) {
 		ts->panel_follower.funcs = &nt36xxx_panel_follower_funcs;
-		devm_drm_panel_add_follower(&client->dev, &ts->panel_follower);
+		ret = devm_drm_panel_add_follower(&client->dev,
+						  &ts->panel_follower);
+		if (ret) {
+			dev_err_probe(&client->dev, ret,
+				      "failed to register panel follower\n");
+			goto err_panelwait_failed;
+		}
 	}
 #endif
 
-	//---eng reset before TP_RESX high
-	nvt_eng_reset();
-	gpiod_set_value_cansleep(ts->reset_gpio, 0);
-
-	// need 10ms delay after POR(power on reset)
-	msleep(10);
-
 	while (!ts->panel_on) {
 		if(retry_count > 5) {
-			ret = -EPROBE_DEFER;
-			NVT_ERR("panel wait failed, ret=%d\n", ret);
+			ret = dev_err_probe(&client->dev, -EPROBE_DEFER,
+					    "panel is not on\n");
 			goto err_panelwait_failed;
 		}
 		NVT_LOG("panel is off, retry=%d\n", retry_count);
@@ -1290,6 +1289,18 @@ static int32_t nvt_ts_probe(struct spi_device *client)
 		msleep(200);
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * The eng reset is the first IC write; it must never hit the panel
+	 * before the follower reports it prepared (a deferred probe used to
+	 * reset a bootloader-lit TDDI and abandon it - the v17 class).
+	 */
+	//---eng reset before TP_RESX high
+	nvt_eng_reset();
+	gpiod_set_value_cansleep(ts->reset_gpio, 0);
+
+	// need 10ms delay after POR(power on reset)
+	msleep(10);
+
 	//---check chip version trim---
 	ret = nvt_ts_check_chip_ver_trim_loop();
 	if (ret) {
